msgstr ""
":doc:`최종 사용자 가이드 </end-user-guide/end-user-guide-index>` - OKR.BEST로 "
"팀 동료와 협업하는 방법을 알아보세요."

#: ../../source/index.rst:47
msgid ""
":doc:`Integrations Guide </integrations-guide/integrations-guide-index>` "
"- Learn how Mattermost is extensible by design and supports a rich "
